# Step translating, a 3d sketch, and a lathe around a line.
key r
move 350 200
down L 350 200
up L 350 200
move 420 300
down L 420 300
up L 420 300
key esc
key t shift
dump
tw
key esc
menu Features|Sketch In 3d
dump
answer ok
menu Sketch|In Workplane
key esc
key s shift
move 300 150
down L 300 150
up L 300 150
move 300 350
down L 300 350
up L 300 350
key esc
dump
save
